  Dialogues:
  - I recently got a new job.
  - I need to catch a fish in the lake.
  - It looks like the fish will mostly come out at night
  - I wonder what kind of fish is this?
  - Tutorial
  - (Go to boat to go fishing)
  - (Try looking around boat for fishing spot)
  - (Click at it and follow it)
  - (The bar will increasing)
  - (When it full, the minigame will start)
  - (Press Arrows or WASD)
  - (The button needs to match the shown buttons)
  - (Then you will get a fish)
  - (After getting enough fish)
  - (Go back to the cabin)
  - (Sleep to start next day)
  - I need to fish for 4 days
